[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m From Equation 2:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{t}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m Now substitute $ t $ from Equation 1a into this:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{1}{60} \cdot \left(60\left(4 - \frac{9}{s}\right)\right)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \left(4 - \frac{9}{s}\right) = 2.4 - 4 + \frac{9}{s} = -1.6 + \frac{9}{s}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
