[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m Case c=1: 3^a *7 ≡1 mod 10. Which is equivalent to 3^a *7 ≡1 => 3^a ≡7^{-1} mod 10. Since 7*3=21≡1 mod 10, so 7^{-1}≡3 mod 10. So 3^a ≡3 mod 10 => 3^{a-1}≡1 mod 10.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
