[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m \frac{9}{s} - \frac{9}{s + 2} = 4 - 2.4 = 1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 9\left( \frac{1}{s} - \frac{1}{s + 2} \right) = 1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m Compute the difference of reciprocals:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m \frac{1}{s} - \frac{1}{s + 2} = \frac{(s + 2) - s}{s(s + 2)} = \frac{2}{s(s + 2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=136437)[0m So:
